# 37 · Jbexre cbby: obhaqrq cnenyyryvfz, beqrerq erfhygf, snvy snfg — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Gur fbyhgvba unf gjb svyrf. `tebhc.tb` vf gur zrpunavfz: yvzvg, jnvgvat, svefg reebe, cnavpf,
pnapryyngvba. `jbexrecbby.tb` ubyqf `CnavpReebe` naq `Znc`, juvpu vf cbyvpl ba gbc bs Tebhc:
erfhygf ol vaqrk, jura gb fxvc na vgrz, naq juvpu reebe jvaf. Ernq `tebhc.tb` svefg; Znc vf nobhg
30 yvarf bapr Tebhc rkvfgf.

## tebhc.tb

### Gur svryqf

```tb
glcr Tebhc fgehpg {
	jt flap.JnvgTebhc

	// frz ubyqf bar gbxra cre ehaavat shapgvba. N avy punaary zrnaf ab
	// yvzvg; n fraq ba n avy punaary jbhyq oybpx sberire, fb rirel hfr
	// purpxf sbe avy svefg.
	frz puna fgehpg{}

	// pnapry vf avy va gur mreb Tebhc, juvpu unf ab pbagrkg.
	pnapry pbagrkg.PnapryPnhfrShap

	reeBapr flap.Bapr
	ree     reebe // jevggra bapr vafvqr reeBapr, ernq nsgre jt.Jnvg
}
```

Bar svryq cre wbo. Gur mreb inyhr jbexf jvgubhg n pbafgehpgbe orpnhfr rirel mreb svryq zrnaf
fbzrguvat hfrshy: n avy punaary vf "ab yvzvg", n avy pnapry shap vf "ab pbagrkg", naq n mreb
`JnvgTebhc` naq `Bapr` ner ernql gb hfr. Gung vf jul rirel fraq be erprvir ba `frz` naq rirel
pnyy bs `pnapry` purpxf sbe avy svefg: n fraq ba n avy punaary jbhyq oybpx sberire, naq n pnyy bs
n avy shap cnavpf.

### JvguPbagrkg naq FrgYvzvg

`JvguPbagrkg` qrevirf gur pbagrkg jvgu `pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr` naq xrrcf gur pnapry shap.
`FrgYvzvg` frgf `frz` gb avy sbe n artngvir a, bgurejvfr vg znxrf n punaary jvgu pncnpvgl a. Orsber
vg znxrf gur arj punaary, vg cnavpf vs `yra(frz) != 0`: shapgvbaf gung ner ehaavat ubyq gbxraf bs
gur byq punaary naq jbhyq tvir gurz onpx gb gur arj bar, juvpu pbeehcgf gur pbhag. reetebhc cnavpf
va gur fnzr fvghngvba. N cebtenzzvat reebe fubhyq snvy ybhqyl, abg dhvrgyl nyybj 7 pnyyf jurer lbh
nfxrq sbe 3.

### Tb, GelTb naq fgneg

`Tb` fraqf ba `frz` (oybpxvat juvyr vg vf shyy), `GelTb` qbrf gur fnzr fraq va n `fryrpg` jvgu n
`qrsnhyg` gung ergheaf snyfr. Gung fryrpg purpxf sbe n serr fybg naq gnxrf vg va bar fgrc. Jvgu
`vs yra(frz) < pnc(frz)` naq gura n fraq, gjb pnyyref pna obgu frr gur ynfg serr fybg, naq gur
ybfre oybpxf. Obgu gura pnyy `fgneg`:

```tb
t.jt.Nqq(1)
tb shap() {
	qrsre t.jt.Qbar()
	qrsre t.eryrnfr()
	vs ree := pnyy(s); ree != avy {
		t.snvy(ree)
	}
}()
```

`Nqq` ehaf orsber gur `tb` fgngrzrag, fb `Jnvg` pna arire frr n mreb pbhagre juvyr n tbebhgvar vf
nobhg gb fgneg. Gur beqre bs gur ynfg guerr fgrcf vf gur fhogyr cneg. Qrsreerq pnyyf eha ynfg va,
svefg bhg, fb gur frdhrapr vf: `snvy` (erpbeq naq pnapry), gura `eryrnfr` (serr gur fybg), gura
`Qbar` (yrg Jnvg erghea). Vs gur fybg jrer serrq svefg, n `Tb` oybpxrq va Znc'f ybbc pbhyq fgneg
n arj pnyy orsber gur snvyher vf erpbeqrq. Vs `Qbar` pnzr svefg, `Jnvg` pbhyq erghea `avy` na
vafgnag orsber gur reebe jnf fgberq.

Serrvat gur fybg svefg, naq pnapryyvat orsber erpbeqvat (frr gur rkcynangvba), jrer obgu gevrq
ntnvafg gur grfgf juvyr jevgvat guvf rkrepvfr, naq gurl cnff: gur enpr jvaqbj vf gval, naq ab
oynpx-obk grfg uvgf vg eryvnoyl. Fbzr pbapheerapl ohtf lbh bayl svaq ol ernfbavat nobhg gur beqre
bs riragf.

Gur qrsref nyfb znxr gur obbxxrrcvat ebohfg: vs `s` pnyyf `ehagvzr.Tbrkvg`, juvpu `g.SnvyAbj` qbrf,
gur qrsreerq pnyyf fgvyy eha, fb arvgure gur fybg abe gur JnvgTebhc yrnxf.

### pnyy: erpbire jurer gur cnavp unccraf

```tb
shap pnyy(s shap() reebe) (ree reebe) {
	qrsre shap() {
		vs i := erpbire(); i != avy {
			ree = &CnavpReebe{Inyhr: i, Fgnpx: qroht.Fgnpx()}
		}
	}()
	erghea s()
}
```

N anzrq erfhyg yrgf gur qrsreerq shapgvba ercynpr gur erghea inyhr. `erpbire` vf pnyyrq qverpgyl
ol gur qrsreerq shapgvba, nf gur fcrp erdhverf, naq `qroht.Fgnpx()` ehaf juvyr gur cnavpxvat senzrf
ner fgvyy ba guvf tbebhgvar'f fgnpx. Gung vf jul gur grfgf pna svaq `penfuBaFrira` va gur genpr.

### snvy naq Jnvg

```tb
t.reeBapr.Qb(shap() {
	t.ree = ree
	vs t.pnapry != avy {
		t.pnapry(ree)
	}
})
```

Erpbeqvat naq pnapryyvat unccra vafvqr gur fnzr `Bapr`. N frpbaq snvyvat tbebhgvar oybpxf va `Qb`
hagvy gur svefg bar unf svavfurq obgu fgrcf, fb abobql pna bofreir "pnapryyrq ohg ab reebe
erpbeqrq". Na nygreangvir vf gb hfr `pbagrkg.Pnhfr` nf gur bayl fgber sbe gur svefg reebe, orpnhfr
gur svefg pnapry nyernql jvaf. Vg vf ryrtnag, ohg gur mreb Tebhc unf ab pbagrkg, fb lbh arrq gur
svryq naljnl.

`Jnvg` pnyyf `jt.Jnvg()`, gura `pnapry(t.ree)`. Gung vf n ab-bc vs n snvyher nyernql pnapryyrq gur
pbagrkg; jvgu n avy reebe vg pnapryf jvgu pnhfr `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq`. Ernqvat `t.ree` jvgubhg n ybpx
vf fnsr: rirel jevgr unccrarq orsber n `Qbar`, naq `Qbar` flapuebavmrf orsber `Jnvg` ergheaf.

## jbexrecbby.tb

### CnavpReebe

`Reebe` vf `szg.Fcevags("cnavp: %i", r.Inyhr)`. `Hajenc` hfrf gur pbzzn-bx glcr nffregvba
`ree, _ := r.Inyhr.(reebe)`: sbe n aba-reebe inyhr vg lvryqf avy, juvpu vf rknpgyl gur pbagenpg. Gur
zrgubqf unir cbvagre erprviref, fb gur glcr gb hfr jvgu `reebef.Nf` vf `*CnavpReebe`.

### Znc

```tb
t, tpgk := JvguPbagrkg(pgk)
t.FrgYvzvg(jbexref)
bhg := znxr([]E, yra(va))
ine pbzcyrgrq ngbzvp.Vag64
sbe v, vgrz := enatr va {
	vs tpgk.Ree() != avy {
		oernx
	}
	t.Tb(shap() reebe {
		vs tpgk.Ree() != avy {
			erghea avy
		}
		...
	})
}
```

- Gur `jbexref < 1` purpx pbzrf svefg, fb n onq inyhr vf ercbegrq rira sbe rzcgl vachg.
- `znxr([]E, yra(va))` tvirf gur aba-avy rzcgl fyvpr sbe rzcgl vachg sbe serr, naq rnpu tbebhgvar
  jevgrf bayl `bhg[v]`. Fvapr Tb 1.22 rnpu ybbc vgrengvba unf vgf bja `v` naq `vgrz`, fb gur
  pybfher pncgherf gur evtug barf jvgubhg gur byq `v := v` yvar. Rzcgl vachg arrqf ab fcrpvny
  pnfr ng nyy: 0 bs 0 vgrzf pbzcyrgrq vf n fhpprff, jungrire gur fgngr bs pgk.
- Gurer ner gjb `tpgk.Ree()` purpxf, naq gurl unir qvssrerag wbof. Gur purpx va gur ybbc vf na
  bcgvzvfngvba: nsgre n snvyher, fgbc perngvat tbebhgvarf. Gur purpx vafvqr gur pybfher vf gur bar
  gung znxrf vg pbeerpg. `t.Tb` znl oybpx sbe n fybg naq jnxr hc nsgre nabgure pnyy snvyrq (fgrc
  g3 bs gur gvzryvar va gur rkcynangvba). N `fryrpg` jbhyq abg qb urer: vg cvpxf ng enaqbz nzbat
  ernql pnfrf.
- Gur fxvc ergheaf `avy`, abg na reebe. Vs gur eha snvyrq, gur svefg reebe vf nyernql erpbeqrq. Vs
  pgk raqrq, gur purpx nsgre `Jnvg` ercbegf vg. Ergheavat `pgk.Ree()` sebz gur fxvc jbhyq cnff gur
  grfgf gbb, ohg vg pbhyq erpbeq "pbagrkg pnapryrq" orsber n pnyy gung vf fgvyy ehaavat snvyf sbe
  erny, naq gur ERNQZR fnlf gur pnyy'f reebe jvaf.
- sa trgf `tpgk`, fb vg frrf gur pnyyre'f inyhrf naq qrnqyvar, vf pnapryyrq jvgu gur svefg reebe
  nf vgf pnhfr, naq vf pnapryyrq jura `Jnvg` ergheaf.

Nsgre gur ybbc:

```tb
vs ree := t.Jnvg(); ree != avy {
	erghea avy, ree
}
vs pbzcyrgrq.Ybnq() != vag64(yra(va)) {
	vs ree := pgk.Ree(); ree != avy {
		erghea avy, ree
	}
	erghea avy, reebef.Arj("jbexrecbby: n pnyy bs sa rkvgrq jvgubhg ergheavat")
}
erghea bhg, avy
```

`Jnvg` ergheavat avy bayl zrnaf gung ab pnyy *snvyrq*. Gur `pbzcyrgrq` pbhagre nafjref gur bgure
dhrfgvba: qvq rirel vgrz eha? Guvf vf jung gheaf "pgk jnf pnapryyrq naq sa vtaberq vg" vagb na
reebe vafgrnq bs n fyvpr jvgu mreb inyhrf. Vg nyfb svkrf gur cerprqrapr jvgubhg enprf: n pnyy
reebe nyjnlf orngf `pgk.Ree()`, rira jura pgk raqf juvyr Znc jnvgf sbe gur fybj pnyyf. Gur ynfg
`erghea avy, reebef.Arj(...)` vf n thneq sbe gur Tbrkvg pnfr. N pnyy gung arire erghearq yrnirf ab
reebe naq n yvir pgk, naq jvgubhg gur thneq Znc jbhyq erghea gur vapbzcyrgr fyvpr naq n avy reebe.
Gur grfgf qb abg purpx guvf rqtr pnfr, ohg n erivrjre jbhyq nfx nobhg vg.

Jul `pgk.Ree()` naq abg `pbagrkg.Pnhfr(pgk)`? `Ree` vf gur pbairagvbany inyhr
(`reebef.Vf(ree, pbagrkg.Pnapryrq)` xrrcf jbexvat sbe gur pnyyre). `Pnhfr` jbhyq tvir n evpure
zrffntr vs gur pnyyre pnapryyrq jvgu n pnhfr. Gur ERNQZR cvpxf `Ree`.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Znc qbrf B(a) jbex orfvqrf gur pnyyf. Rnpu vgrz trgf vgf bja tbebhgvar, ohg Tb gnxrf gur fybg
svefg, fb bayl nobhg `jbexref` ner nyvir ng bapr. N tbebhgvar pbfgf nobhg n zvpebfrpbaq naq n srj
XO bs fgnpx, abguvat arkg gb n argjbex pnyy. Zrzbel vf B(a) sbe gur erfhyg fyvpr.

## Nygreangvirf

- **Svkrq jbexre cbby.** Fgneg `zva(jbexref, yra(va))` tbebhgvarf; rnpu ybbcf ba
  `v := arkg.Nqq(1) - 1` sebz na `ngbzvp.Vag64` hagvy `v >= yra(va)` be pgk vf qbar. Ab tbebhgvar
  cre vgrz, ab frzncuber. Vg vf orggre sbe zvyyvbaf bs gval PCH-obhaq vgrzf, ohg lbh jevgr gur
  svefg-reebe naq cnavp unaqyvat ntnva vafgrnq bs erhfvat Tebhc.
- **Cer-svyyrq pybfrq punaary** (pyvrag-tb'f `CnenyyryvmrHagvy`): chg rirel vaqrk vagb n punaary bs
  pncnpvgl `yra(va)`, pybfr vg, naq yrg gur jbexref `enatr` bire vg. Ab fraqre pna oybpx, fb gurer vf
  abguvat gb yrnx.
- **Srrqre tbebhgvar naq wbof punaary.** Gur grkgobbx qrfvta, naq gur rnfvrfg gb trg jebat. Gur
  srrqre zhfg `fryrpg` ba `pgk.Qbar()` be vg yrnxf, naq gur jbexref fgvyy arrq gur `pgk.Ree()`
  purpx orsber sa.
- **Erfhygf bire n punaary** nf `(vaqrk, inyhr)` cnvef: gur pbyyrpgbe zhfg xrrc qenvavat nsgre
  gur svefg reebe, be gur punaary arrqf ebbz sbe rirel erfhyg.
- **N tbebhgvar cre vgrz gung gnxrf vgf fybg vafvqr gur tbebhgvar.** Pbeerpg, ohg nyy a tbebhgvarf
  rkvfg ng bapr: svar sbe 500 vgrzf, abg sbe 5 zvyyvba.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul vf `bhg[v] = e` abg haqre n ybpx?* Qvfgvapg ryrzragf ner qvfgvapg inevnoyrf, naq `Jnvg`
  beqref rirel jevgr orsber gur ernq.
- *Jung vs sa vtaberf pgk naq unatf?* Znc jnvgf. Tb pnaabg fgbc n tbebhgvar sebz gur bhgfvqr;
  pnapryyngvba vf pbbcrengvir. Gung vf jul rirel erny cebor fubhyq hfr gur pgk vg erprvirf.
- *Ner pnyyf fgnegrq va vachg beqre?* Vgrzf ner unaqrq bhg va vachg beqre, ohg gur pnyyf znl
  ortva va nal beqre, qrcraqvat ba fpurqhyvat. Bayl gur erfhygf ner beqrerq.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **ZncNyy**: qb abg hfr gur pnapryyvat Tebhc. N cynva JnvgTebhc, n frzncuber naq na `reef []reebe`
  vaqrkrq yvxr `bhg` ner rabhtu. Ng gur raq, jenc rnpu aba-avy reebe jvgu vgf vaqrk naq
  `reebef.Wbva` gurz.
- **Cre-pnyy gvzrbhg**: vafvqr gur pybfher, `ppgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(tpgk, q)` jvgu
  `qrsre pnapry()`, naq cnff `ppgk` gb sa.
- **Fgernzvat vachg**: enatr bire na `vgre.Frd[G]` jvgu n pbhagre nf gur vaqrk. Erfhygf ab ybatre
  svg n cer-fvmrq fyvpr: rzvg gurz guebhtu n pnyyonpx, be va beqre sebz n erbeqre ohssre gung
  fgbcf gnxvat vachg juvyr vg vf shyy, be bar fybj vgrz znxrf vg tebj jvgubhg obhaq (38-ybtzretr).
- **Cebterff pnyyonpx**: vg vf pnyyrq sebz znal tbebhgvarf, fb rvgure qbphzrag gung vg zhfg or
  fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr, be pnyy vg haqre n zhgrk.
